ined"},"raw_description":{"encoding":"UTF-8","text":"1、根据业务实际需要，拟订相应合同文本，并根据业务发展情况和经营过程中反应的问题不断优化；\n2、负责部门文档管理，包括法务管理业务相关的各类文件、资料、档案等（含纸质、电子等形式）；\n3、参与项目相关的日常沟通联络，往来函件的整理；\n4、负责处理发生的的诉讼纠纷，庭前材料准备及方案论证，庭后编写报告并形成法律风险建议书下发业务部门；\n5、对各部门进行法律培训，提高员工风险防范意识，同时普及基础法律知识。"},"raw_location_text":[{"encoding":"UTF-8","text":"上海市"},{"encoding":"UTF-8","text":"青岛市"}],"raw_organization_name":{"encoding":"UTF-8","text":"海尔集团"},"raw_requirement_text":{"encoding":"UTF-8","text":"1、2027届应届毕业生，本科及以上学历，英语六级及以上；\n2、法律等相关专业；\n1、有法律职业资格，精通民法、民事诉讼法、劳动法及劳动仲裁相关法规；\n2、熟悉常用OFFICE办公软件；\n3、对英语熟悉，看懂英语文件；\n1、性格外向、善于沟通、执行力强，表达能力好；\n2、身体健康，品行端正，无任何不良行为记录或诚信记录。"},"raw_source_record_id":"haier-rid-61:legal-position","raw_title":{"encoding":"UTF-8","text":"法务"},"recruitment_batch":{"encoding":"UTF-8","text":"海尔集团2027校园招聘"},"recruitment_context":{"announcement":{"evidence_locator":{"kind":"HTML","selector":".campus_joblist_wrap"},"identifier_namespace":"official:haier:campus-position","identity_state":"CONFIRMED","official_identifier":{"encoding":"UTF-8","text":"haier-campus-sid-64-rid-61"}},"opportunity":{"evidence_locator":{"kind":"HTML","selector":".campus_joblist_wrap .detail_cnt"},"identity_state":"PROVISIONAL","source_local_identifier":{"encoding":"UTF-8","text":"haier-campus-sid-64-rid-61:opportunity"}},"position":{"evidence_locator":{"kind":"HTML","selector":".campus_joblist_wrap .detail_cnt"},"identity_state":"PROVISIONAL","source_local_identifier":{"encoding":"UTF-8","text":"haier-campus-sid-64-rid-61"}},"recruitment_batch":{"applicability":"APPLICABLE","identity":{"evidence_locator":{"kind":"HTML","selector":".campus_joblist_wrap .job_name"},"identity_state":"PROVISIONAL","source_local_identifier":{"encoding":"UTF-8","text":"海尔集团2027校园招聘"}}},"recruitment_plan":{"evidence_locator":{"kind":"HTML","selector":".campus_joblist_wrap"},"identity_state":"PROVISIONAL","source_local_identifier":{"encoding":"UTF-8","text":"haier-group-2027-campus-recruitment"}}},"recruitment_year":{"encoding":"UTF-8","text"